{"title":"2014 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a square of side length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The rectangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/3/c6384882422fca17b6b8bb0cb58a405d46e64590.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$JKHG$\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/4/3741880b2be02e109cbcfee03c72268f4d391678.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EBCF$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> are congruent. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7baf95ecafc2d7791788ec79aeeae390d60b119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/c/2bcdf33d78300cd05d4666fa9c8ae141650dd693.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A=(1,0), B=(0,0), C=(0,1), D=(1,1), E=(2-sqrt(3),0), F=(2-sqrt(3),1), G=(1,sqrt(3)/2), H=(2.5-sqrt(3),1), J=(.5,0), K=(2-sqrt(3),1-sqrt(3)/2); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle); draw(K--H--G--J--cycle); draw(F--E); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SE); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,NW); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,NE); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,S); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,F,N); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,G,E); label(&quot;$H$&quot;,H,N); label(&quot;$J$&quot;,J,S); label(&quot;$K$&quot;,K,W); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"248\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8d0477a7049e1e8ff02f0efd6c0762bd07880f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{6}-2)\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{1}{4}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }2-\\sqrt{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 1-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"545\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Draw the altitude from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and call the foot <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/a/81a9dfa12681a0c1517ddb3b41e05d1cc0d982ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HL=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />. Consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d955e610cf3fd94003dcfc4f48a32c9074059f68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HJ$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />. It is the hypotenuse of both right triangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/b/cabcce6d4aa50bad8be3b1fb74936ab555e11f30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle HGJ$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/1/ec11475036355c2f83064cf0de5cd26856e717fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle HLJ$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />, and we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/8/9f8f4956bdae8f7b6afb302cc363158dc756f2bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$JG=HL=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"111\" height=\"13\" />, so we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b92b25ece23cc03166884c5d21c753426ad4579d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle HGJ\\cong\\triangle JLH$\" width=\"140\" height=\"13\" /> by Hypotenuse-Leg congruence. From this congruence we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/d/17d95bb3853ada137680749d82f0211d3c05f040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$LJ=HG=BE$\" width=\"132\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Notice that all four triangles in this picture are similar. Also, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/4/d649d20e7c046cee27bfab098a724e7d379e3f58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$LA=HD=EJ$\" width=\"133\" height=\"13\" />. So set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/7/1772ccc1668d4b612874bbf711aef83fc0ee0ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=LJ=HG=BE$\" width=\"167\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/d/b5df5f10b73fcbd6e650d2b47626071663a0710f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=LA=HD=EJ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"169\" height=\"18\" />. Now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/2/f12199c704ba90b0ef41d6fc86182b0f4511eba0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE+EJ+JL+LA=2(x+y)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"294\" height=\"18\" />. This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2c90eaaae28c69330a7f942b5b2ba0e14a75833.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=\\frac{1}{2}=BE+EJ=BJ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"232\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abb5588023cfa1ac14643e9778699f03eecc57a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$J$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/f/cdfea25671bb540ce456b6292d16b2e8a5a1eead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AJG$\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" />, along with all other similar triangles in the picture, is a 30-60-90 triangle, and we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659e7e94431ff546f9a68a146ba54b6420316020.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG=\\sqrt{3} \\cdot AJ=\\sqrt{3}/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"21\" /> and subsequently <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bb646912ea1deaf6746cf272e202e879e871a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GD=\\frac{2-\\sqrt{3}}{2}=KE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"168\" height=\"41\" />. This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/2/3a2f90ccfff031fdbf518d8f500da64bae77629e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EJ=\\sqrt{3} \\cdot KE=\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}-3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"210\" height=\"41\" />, which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c5e4dca1d01c4cac5228f60df046d2579cf909c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE=\\frac{1}{2}-EJ=\\frac{4-2\\sqrt{3}}{2}=2-\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"288\" height=\"41\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/169b8d69bd74a91e72ec43123070d770633a340a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/836fc8df474c105a5af0235bd19569b3e910150c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE = x$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/128a7d74dff156076e8eeca59e0ed4e28b828807.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$JA = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />.  Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/2/ee240039fcfa8e34491c40cd4ec9bac25025dc41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle FKH = \\angle EJK = \\angle AGJ = \\angle DHG$\" width=\"300\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/a/20ab2c9efd9b002d0327f22826ba5c54f4b70117.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle FHK = \\angle EKJ = \\angle AJG = \\angle DGH$\" width=\"301\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/4/8641e79a59f95dbc86b925f3b66bc8690a658f6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle KEJ, \\triangle JAG, \\triangle GDH, \\triangle HFK$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"262\" height=\"17\" /> are all similar.  Using proportions and the pythagorean theorem, we find \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/5/785588551ec946dc3b42fb8bc609df93acfcd4a6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[EK = xy\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/2/7029a2070421be2ee854bd23e5d0877576f83802.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[FK = \\sqrt{1-y^2}\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"22\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/e/c0ee9b75e01b2113446171e87e4a0d8c07736035.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[EJ = x\\sqrt{1-y^2}\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"22\" />\nBecause we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/5/865ed4ba6c9f52d9d52ab108933984491dfb6c56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE+EJ+AJ = EK + FK = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"269\" height=\"16\" />, we can set up a systems of equations and solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/0846165d0ec35d01dd1946f41e7f1599d7064fd4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + x\\sqrt{1-y^2} + y = 1 \\implies x= \\frac{1-y}{1+\\sqrt{1-y^2}}\\]\" width=\"354\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd92228a505ed6670bda0d8758ad6516cad65128.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xy + \\sqrt{1-y^2} = 1 \\implies x= \\frac{1-\\sqrt{1-y^2}}{y}\\]\" width=\"322\" height=\"43\" />\nNow solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we get \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/5/8556fd44bd4b14ce5e8ca10ff07be7c2324212c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1-y}{1+\\sqrt{1-y^2}}=\\frac{1-\\sqrt{1-y^2}}{y} \\implies y(1-y)=(1-\\sqrt{1-y^2})(1+\\sqrt{1-y^2}) \\implies y-y^2=y^2 \\implies y=\\frac{1}{2}\\]\" width=\"783\" height=\"44\" />\nPlugging into the second equations with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/9664cc2c4434245482eb8076d8667e464fc74a79.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x= 2\\left(1-\\sqrt{1-\\frac{1}{4}}\\right) = 2\\left(\\frac{2-\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\right) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2-\\sqrt{3}}\\]\" width=\"417\" height=\"53\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/836fc8df474c105a5af0235bd19569b3e910150c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE = x$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/c/07ccbe7d22bb4c89c457aafa39dab4bdd5bc7cc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EK = a$\" width=\"65\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/37628d59796443d2e6b229ebeb9c05db09cef5ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EJ = b$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84c135ea351367c6eed6925024e8721a11071a78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = a^2 + b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" /> and because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e9a842b7dc83d2f34cc600cb38d14ca14f301d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle KEJ \\cong \\triangle GDH$\" width=\"146\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/a/90a4d665bca8bdbbdc24f21b29e14ea9b359f258.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle KEJ \\sim \\triangle JAG$\" width=\"139\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/8/2489685517b085632234dee85e243af5e64e9492.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{GA}{1} = 1 - a = \\frac{b}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"134\" height=\"38\" />. Furthermore, the area of the four triangles and the two rectangles sums to 1:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/b/e8bd47a57cac228aef3dbf4148bb5fd4cb1fc0f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 = 2x + GA\\cdot JA + ab\\]\" width=\"179\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/c/8bce9c47f8fc51893bd8c731cf8b067c7c65584c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 = 2x + (1 - a)(1 - (x + b)) + ab\\]\" width=\"268\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/8/0a869771eb0b6a3f06131ae41adfd2d85167221d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 = 2x + \\frac{b}{x}(1 - x - b) + \\left(1 - \\frac{b}{x}\\right)b\\]\" width=\"278\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/d/b3dd38566adf6c195ce1c278c1dc8b65003b5bad.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 = 2x + \\frac{b}{x} - b - \\frac{b^2}{x} + b - \\frac{b^2}{x}\\]\" width=\"229\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92f09b5d420dee0fe4ba2fb6f459d45cf7b47d9e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = 2x^2 + b - 2b^2\\]\" width=\"136\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/c/90cebf6e95afb8063e38bc95cc18470679cb5f73.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x - b = 2(x - b)(x + b)\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/9/9a964dfad6b052f23030389e7652cb4adeba715d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + b = \\frac{1}{2}\\]\" width=\"75\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44ba012cf6d83f254f175bda2f32d85ab797b46f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b = \\frac{1}{2} - x\\]\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/6/1f6c12d41051ae28da8d9cca2fbe4bcff0b50cbc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = 1 - \\frac{b}{x} = 2 - \\frac{1}{2x}\\]\" width=\"156\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>By the Pythagorean theorem: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84c135ea351367c6eed6925024e8721a11071a78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = a^2 + b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad00c179f32b2d3635694ddbfeb53ec6a76a43d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 = \\left(2 - \\frac{1}{2x}\\right)^2 + \\left(\\frac{1}{2} - x\\right)^2\\]\" width=\"230\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/4/e14129d42c0996c22f16b14f779d492021858db8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 = 4 - \\frac{2}{x} + \\frac{1}{4x^2} + \\frac{1}{4} - x + x^2\\]\" width=\"247\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/9/339f21094a53dbb3a825e0eeaf2bcae22b0abd8c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 =  \\frac{1}{4x^2} - \\frac{2}{x} + \\frac{17}{4} - x\\]\" width=\"177\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/3/c738487431d1f5477323ad61e82223338d3a74da.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 = 1 - 8x + 17x^2 - 4x^3.\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Then by the rational root theorem, this has roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c339afa03e060d959e4942be7522c0c992f4c41c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/5/ef5c41888a61f8466c8dedb3043d39ea11b13a2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 - \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/9/1f9b4eec2b1b37f7d7705eff3aaf385e2f673044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />. The first and last roots are extraneous because they imply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b5969c2cfb1ffadf981fbbddcf796c8eb0037546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 0$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/3767f0665ea4d5f0e9c58452fc5782b42a8a65a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, respectively, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/1/091d83f410637a0bee050f3e4fbd18f31c09fe07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2-\\sqrt{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"136\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/1/341b874cd4fc603f081f24db8f424ff675730c79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle FKH$\" width=\"60\" height=\"12\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/d/07d29465728e92952374a857beaee91665d8dbd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CF$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.  It is shown that all four triangles in the picture are similar.  From the square side lengths:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81f54478ea4344729f59150cb5bab20038e8a05f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a + \\sin(k) \\cdot 1 + \\cos(k) \\cdot a = 1\\]\" width=\"225\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/6/b46ba01da3d8ab016e15290e497fd6ef20598385.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sin(k)a + \\cos(k) = 1\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"18\" />\nSolving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651926b00f24bf198dfab9361bdcb51a6f280a15.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = \\frac{1-\\sin(k)}{\\cos(k) + 1} = \\frac{1 - \\cos(k)}{\\sin(k)}\\]\" width=\"223\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/e/6ce33b88b929bb0b48e31719b8f25fa45289ace0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1-\\sin(k)) \\cdot sin(k) = (1 - \\cos(k))\\cdot(\\cos(k) + 1)\\]\" width=\"377\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/326b638fc5f047a453dcebdef85f2947e817e624.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sin(k)-\\sin(k)^2 = \\cos(k) + 1 - \\cos(k)^2 - \\cos(k)\\]\" width=\"373\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/72238609987b5c117961d7388f71a09b7d2151cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sin(k)-\\sin(k)^2 = \\sin(k)^2\\]\" width=\"199\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/2/ee2a1c0217a3f9f697c1d142a64052bb7ad8e0bd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1-\\sin(k) = \\sin(k)\\]\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/d/a9ddd0bf0cec3a16c281c9de68449bdc1011f225.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sin(k) = \\frac{1}{2}, \\cos(k) = \\frac{\\sqrt 3}{2}\\]\" width=\"191\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/f/09f620032451b8d0e4478015f6305d3a6834c30d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = \\frac{1 - \\frac{\\sqrt 3}{2}}{\\frac{1}{2}} = 2 - \\sqrt 3\\]\" width=\"170\" height=\"50\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d955e610cf3fd94003dcfc4f48a32c9074059f68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HJ$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> is a diagonal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/3/c6384882422fca17b6b8bb0cb58a405d46e64590.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$JKHG$\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" />, so it must be equal in length to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/9/59910c059976e19ba94be84e4dab4701a119d5ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FB$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />. Therefore, quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c9623a8be8ab919b71ecee458a1923c195a9a775.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FHJB$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7bc05e8a1c0c5ab2de15a773db4b3fd0bf51793.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FH\\parallel BJ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/a/a1a82edef57380985d0a4651d665615f435a7529.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FB=HJ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />, so it must be either an isosceles trapezoid or a parallelogram. But due to the slope of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/9/59910c059976e19ba94be84e4dab4701a119d5ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FB$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d955e610cf3fd94003dcfc4f48a32c9074059f68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HJ$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />, we see that it must be a parallelogram. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/4/c54bb35dc92d366274808aeadcf6244244180481.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FH=BJ$\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" />. But by the symmetry in rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/e/c6e4b9dcc08bde315900943b03663f36e9373715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FEAD$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/4/d6486206e34fb860a70a5d621a5575aa4fdf7eb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FH=JA$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/926288a70888e3ce14c0f71a731198235779cd36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BJ=FH=JA$\" width=\"131\" height=\"13\" />. We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/b/26bfe47a566498e6e0f109dd573d073820e37e30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BJ+JA=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"14\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/a/6aaa400de15b483302d50e30f61e1173053165b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BJ=JA=\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"112\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/c/b0c0185a36a45ee7a0635bcc364017e0c16fc2bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$JG=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cf6b1965c0ed487a386c848662e067c700d0dd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$JA=\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"61\" height=\"37\" />, and as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77dfd3d2bee62255f9a1fa5f40e619250723d639.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle GJA$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is right, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77dfd3d2bee62255f9a1fa5f40e619250723d639.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle GJA$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> must be a 30-60-90 triangle. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/f/01f98074103ea0aed2dfdeeeeb0fa2567b383adb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GA=\\sqrt{3}/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7c99f192f92066b598b37ec32af871813bc5139.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DG=1-\\sqrt{3}/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"21\" />. But by similarity, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/4/a3496242cb32237134d9d790f77ec6b1eb792027.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DHG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" /> is also a 30-60-90 triangle, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/1/5f1eea54cdfc5b5d15ae0087827764d98a3efd8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DH=\\sqrt{3}-3/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"21\" />. But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/c/64cde519984801c853895d95f51682cebdf64d42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DHG\\cong\\triangle EJK$\" width=\"146\" height=\"13\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/c/becefd4932c762a3924ef9c67f9579d77e3eaeb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EJ=\\sqrt{3}-3/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"21\" />. As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/d/e7dceb4fd7496a4ab47ab13bfd185431a9525dd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BJ=1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />, this implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03e097f804559bafce3f4f9229178ea0db671f1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE=BJ-EJ=1/2-\\sqrt{3}+3/2=2-\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"356\" height=\"21\" />. Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/836fc8df474c105a5af0235bd19569b3e910150c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE = x$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab06755f362728feeeb1cbbd488fab08b3e5b6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KE = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"64\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/8/ea82ed350a8c12df07ce94a5e4fece197d9abf71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DG = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/4/3d4f8c60ff4c7f12f6c9f0068340941296ea9768.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG = 1-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eac2c1a5c419d59cde33c71e10990bfe377655.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KJ = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/0/050192e70ccd2a2f07d8de1c89cc698dc937eab0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$JG = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/c/c2cc0b2bb79430bf32d504df1206dd3333fa9fdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AJ}{JG} = \\frac{KE}{JK}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"39\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c50a336673b6db245d69f8e23ddb440a579cd8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AJ = \\frac{y}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"34\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd58855c7f293ccc2d966ccae51b587fe77f1289.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EJ = 1 - x - \\frac{y}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"131\" height=\"34\" />, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/0/2f0169b20945c55de60f329e94c23dd60ad0d2c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AG}{JG} = \\frac{EJ}{JK}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"39\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/5/db5809b5b90f57070b0606c9c388a4e3158c2422.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-y = \\frac{1 - x - \\frac{y}{x}}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"146\" height=\"41\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/728deeeb1a071441655b25ddb16e747739e3557c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - xy = 1 - x - \\frac{y}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"34\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/f/a6fde6f9fd2cddf9eca2358f02e071121c55dd41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^2 - x^2y + y - x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"176\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fce2d831f25cbd63b02ddc99870650b40b6086e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AJ^2 + AG^2 = JG^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/b/10b06befd63425dc1885a313896d454d35a97e45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( \\frac{y}{x} \\right) ^2 + (1-y)^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"163\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/104e75457e06d3dd1fdf61b92fe6cfa4b4fe3448.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y^2}{x^2} + 1 - 2y + y^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"168\" height=\"41\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37e70046543ceee4bb54d7904072532e27c98f75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 y -2x^2 + y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/5/5456aa005832fe81f1a111836895ef8a06146013.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1) + (2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/f/dbff72bfb472464d1f8c749a4306cddfa4667414.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y - x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/1/271debc065f7e224cb84abc647ffbdf5a19f8d81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{x}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p>Substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/9/3899217113fe1c926231520b8c167d0b037ddbcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 \\cdot \\frac{x}{2} - 2 x^2 + \\frac{x}{2} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"166\" height=\"34\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/9/379b4eb9dbbd68fc49a5526b11042040d7749adb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 4x + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/e/ffe05b97cfbaa871ca4de504d0e965fb2f7e7251.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{4 \\pm \\sqrt{16-4}}{2} = 2 \\pm \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"216\" height=\"42\" />, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1faf5d41cd05857f8f0cbab1eb5a41bb1a6741f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a2bb935ade12d9a5bd62ef9ef47a5212b7fd44c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}2 - \\sqrt{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"132\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Isabelchen\">isabelchen</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B\">2014 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/ind